Dependencies
--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Rust crates and npm packages keep their own licences. Generate the list with
`cargo about` / `cargo deny list` and `pnpm licenses list`. System libraries
such as GStreamer are loaded dynamically from the user's system.

Hosted plugin support (Packet 4.1) embeds the
[Clack](https://github.com/enzo1981/clack) suite (crates `clack-host`,
`clack-plugin`, `clack-common`, `clack-extensions`,
Licence: MIT OR Apache-2.0, texts generated by the crates' own licence terms).
EEP links `clack-host` as the CLAP plugin host for `saturn-audio-dsp`; no
Clack source code is copied into EEP.

